From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:01:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wineserver: port the iOS replacements onto wine-11.18

request: create_thread's thread is now added with add_process_thread.
mapping: image data directories go through GET_DATA_DIR (ml936's reloc_dir
is the BASERELOC directory's presence); the user-data mapping is a
create_named_object with mapping_init_data. mach: the arm64 integer block is
x0[18] and x19[12] (x18 moved to the TLS block, not reported). window: the
iOS desktop auto-create passes create_window's dpi arguments as the force
path does.

Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
